# Data safety

- Do not store passport, SEVIS, SSN, EAD/visa scans, ATS passwords, or ID images in the repo.
- Tokens/secrets belong in `.env` / OS keychain — never commit.
- No auto-send of email, LinkedIn, applications, or calendar writes without confirmation.
- Calendar generation defaults to dry-run.
- Do not publish demo account passwords in resumes or public artifacts.
